; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    49  **                      Private Type Definitions                              **
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    50  *******************************************************************************/
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    51  /*
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    52  Configuration:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    53  PWM Channel Configuration:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    54  Elements / Attributes
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    55  1. Notification function pointer (if required)
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    56  2. Shift Value, only for PWM_FIXED_PERIOD_SHIFTED Class
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    57     Input a value between 0 and 0x8000.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    58  3. Default Duty Cycle ( duty cycle value between
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    59     0 and 0x8000)
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    60  4. Pwm_Period:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    61     Enter in ticks
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    62     PWM070: All time units should be in ticks.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    63  5. Pwm_ConfigChannel:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    64     Go in the following parameter order
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    65     a) Reference to Channel Number, for a Shifted, Center Aligned and
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    66     Zero Shifted channel, a reference must be given. For a variable
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    67     and Fixed Period channel class, reference should not be given.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    68     Reference should be given in the form of channel number index.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    69     b) Channel Class
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    70        Possible Options: PWM_FIXED_PERIOD, PWM_FIXED_PERIOD_SHIFTED,
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    71        PWM_FIXED_PERIOD_CENTER_ALIGNED, PWM_VARIABLE_PERIOD
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    72     c) Channel Idle State:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    73        Possible Options: PWM_LOW, PWM_HIGH
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    74        Output line goes into Idle state either after Pwm_SetOutputtoIdle
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    75        or Pwm_DeInit.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    76     d) Channel Polarity:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    77        Possible Options: PWM_LOW, PWM_HIGH
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    78        Initial Polarity state of the channel.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    79     e) GTM timer Configuration:
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    80        Select timer reference :TOM/ATOM.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    81        Clockselect.
; ..\Appl\GenData\src\Pwm_17_GtmCcu6_PBcfg.c	    82   */
